ός" strong="G5207" x-morph="N-NSM" x-gloss="Son" x-translit="huios" xml:lang="grc">υἱὸς</char> <char style="w" x-id="SBLGNT.JHN.5.27.009" x-align="JHN.5.27.a010" x-target-ids="t014 t015" x-target="of man" x-target-head="t015" x-head="true" lemma="ἄνθρωπος" strong="G444" x-morph="N-GSM" x-gloss="of Man" x-translit="anthrōpou" xml:lang="grc">ἀνθρώπου</char> <char style="w" x-id="SBLGNT.JHN.5.27.010" x-align="JHN.5.27.a008" x-target-ids="t010 t011" x-target="he is" x-target-head="t011" x-head="true" lemma="εἰμί" strong="G2076" x-morph="V-PAI-3S" x-gloss="He is" x-translit="estin" xml:lang="grc">ἐστίν</char>.<verse eid="JHN 5:27" /></para>
